2a     | Resolution Professional - Corporate Debtors| ${ process_counts['cirp'] }
2b     | Resolution Professional - Individuals      | ${ process_counts['iirp'] }
3a     | Liquidator - Liquidation Processes         | ${ process_counts['cilp'] }
